02:05:45,870 --> 02:05:45,990
Yeah.

2491
02:05:50,550 --> 02:05:51,050
Oh, God!

2492
02:05:51,930 --> 02:05:52,690
What the hell?

2493
02:05:57,560 --> 02:05:57,960
Oh!

2494
02:05:58,540 --> 02:05:59,360
That's kind of scary.

2495
02:06:00,000 --> 02:06:01,040
That looks impossible!

2496
02:06:03,840 --> 02:06:04,240
Unless...

2497
02:06:04,240 --> 02:06:05,280
Invisible bridge!

2498
02:06:09,010 --> 02:06:09,830
No, I don't...

2499
02:06:09,830 --> 02:06:11,450
I don't think that's...

2500
02:06:12,090 --> 02:06:12,970
How that works.

2501
02:06:14,270 --> 02:06:15,430
These things are not even scary.

2502
02:06:18,030 --> 02:06:19,450
We'll be back to explore this later.

2503
02:06:21,190 --> 02:06:22,610
There's more to be done here, for sure.

2504
02:06:22,730 --> 02:06:23,270
Let's go inside.

2505
02:06:28,020 --> 02:06:29,660
Oh, we got a huge face here.

2506
02:06:29,820 --> 02:06:31,040
Is that a Dodongo face?

2507
02:06:31,660 --> 02:06:32,280
Oh, no, wait.

2508
02:06:32,340 --> 02:06:33,020
That's like a lizard.

2509
02:06:33,540 --> 02:06:35,080
Maybe it's a...

2510
02:06:35,080 --> 02:06:36,700
Personified Dodongo.

2511
02:06:38,640 --> 02:06:39,100
Persongo.

2512
02:06:42,450 --> 02:06:43,930
Looks like we're climbing in the void.

2513
02:06:53,870 --> 02:06:54,690
Wow.

2514
02:06:54,910 --> 02:06:56,730
That was quite the ladder.

2515
02:07:00,940 --> 02:07:02,320
Fire temple.

2516
02:07:10,480 --> 02:07:10,940
Easy.

2517
02:07:11,600 --> 02:07:13,300
I'm gonna nail this dungeon.

2518
02:07:14,980 --> 02:07:16,020
You'll see.

2519
02:07:26,010 --> 02:07:26,530
Ah!

2520
02:07:26,910 --> 02:07:27,590
A door.

2521
02:07:30,550 --> 02:07:32,390
Oh, you can hear the weight behind that door.

2522
02:07:32,590 --> 02:07:33,290
Great sound design.

2523
02:07:34,470 --> 02:07:36,230
Why is that, uh...

2524
02:07:36,230 --> 02:07:36,790
Pot...

2525
02:07:36,790 --> 02:07:37,750
Oh, it's a Goron.

2526
02:07:44,080 --> 02:07:44,500
Whoa.

2527
02:07:48,990 --> 02:07:50,070
Oh, I like it.

2528
02:07:53,790 --> 02:07:54,990
Oh, great music.

2529
02:07:55,530 --> 02:07:55,590
Oh, great music.

2530
02:07:56,450 --> 02:07:58,210
Please, don't eat me.

2531
02:07:59,270 --> 02:08:01,490
If you eat something like me, you'll get a stomachache.

2532
02:08:02,550 --> 02:08:03,430
You'll be sorry.

2533
02:08:04,130 --> 02:08:05,310
Don't worry, I'm not gonna eat you.

2534
02:08:06,170 --> 02:08:08,150
I'm here on, uh...

2535
02:08:08,150 --> 02:08:09,090
Link's behest.

2536
02:08:09,710 --> 02:08:10,730
At the behest of Link.

2537
02:08:10,810 --> 02:08:11,210
The other Link.

2538
02:08:14,220 --> 02:08:15,480
I'm here to talk to his dad.

2539
02:08:17,380 --> 02:08:19,580
Finally, I get to talk to his dad.

2540
02:08:19,820 --> 02:08:20,900
See what his dad is all about.

2541
02:08:24,330 --> 02:08:26,050
See what the dad is like in these parts.

2542
02:08:31,310 --> 02:08:32,830
The music is perfect for this place.

2543
02:08:32,990 --> 02:08:34,270
It's absolutely perfect.

2544
02:08:35,650 --> 02:08:36,970
We need the, uh...

2545
02:08:36,970 --> 02:08:37,430
Lens here.

2546
02:08:42,100 --> 02:08:42,620
Maybe.

2547
02:08:43,900 --> 02:08:44,920
Going left first.

2548
02:08:45,620 --> 02:08:47,560
Okay, priority is to find a dungeon map.

2549
02:08:48,700 --> 02:08:49,220
Oh!

2550
02:08:51,040 --> 02:08:51,860
Who's there?

2551
02:08:52,900 --> 02:08:53,420
Is...

2552
02:08:53,420 --> 02:08:54,240
That you?

2553
02:08:54,860 --> 02:08:55,240
Link?

2554
02:08:56,980 --> 02:08:58,120
Oh, it really is, Link!

2555
02:08:59,020 --> 02:09:01,320
You've grown so big since I last saw you.

2556
02:09:02,180 --> 02:09:04,540
I want to have a man-to-man talk with you.

2557
02:09:05,260 --> 02:09:06,260
But now's not the time.

2558
02:09:07,440 --> 02:09:09,780
Ganondorf is causing trouble on Death Mountain again.

2559
02:09:10,160 --> 02:09:13,340
He has revived the evil ancient dragon, Volvagia.

2560
02:09:14,360 --> 02:09:15,720
On top of that...

2561
02:09:15,720 --> 02:09:19,780
He's gonna feed my people to that evil dragon as a warning to other races...

2562
02:09:19,780 --> 02:09:20,940
That might resist him.

2563
02:09:21,940 --> 02:09:24,940
If that fire-breathing dragon escapes from the mountain...

2564
02:09:24,940 --> 02:09:27,620
All of Hyrule will become a burning wasteland.

2565
02:09:28,640 --> 02:09:31,400
I will go on ahead to try to seal up the evil dragon.

2566
02:09:32,380 --> 02:09:33,560
I'm concerned, though.

2567
02:09:33,560 --> 02:09:35,720
Because I don't have the legendary hammer.

2568
02:09:36,440 --> 02:09:37,640
But I have no choice.

2569
02:09:38,620 --> 02:09:39,000
Link!

2570
02:09:39,560 --> 02:09:42,080
I'm asking you to do this as my sworn brother.

2571
02:09:43,160 --> 02:09:45,600
While I'm trying to deal with the dragon...

2572
02:09:45,600 --> 02:09:47,100
Please save my people.

2573
02:09:48,180 --> 02:09:49,880
The prisoner's selves...

2574
02:09:49,880 --> 02:09:51,180
Are in the opposite direction.

2575
02:09:51,700 --> 02:09:52,900
I'm counting on you, Link!

2576
02:09:53,940 --> 02:09:54,700
Okay, man!

2577
02:09:54,800 --> 02:09:55,340
We got this!

2578
02:09:55,640 --> 02:09:56,420
Hell yeah!

2579
02:09:58,920 --> 02:09:59,840
Good luck, bro!

2580
02:10:00,480 --> 02:10:01,500
I'll see you later.

2581
02:10:02,200 --> 02:10:03,180
I'll do my part.

2582
02:10:03,360 --> 02:10:03,740
I promise.

2583
02:10:05,860 --> 02:10:06,520
Oh my god.

2584
02:10:06,640 --> 02:10:07,560
Don't fall in the lava here.

2585
02:10:10,060 --> 02:10:12,000
We need a snapple hook.

2586
02:10:17,200 --> 02:10:17,780
Snapple me!

2587
02:10:25,380 --> 02:10:27,580
Link, the embarrassing swordsman...

2588
02:10:28,120 --> 02:10:28,780
Strikes again.

2589
02:10:28,960 --> 02:10:30,120
Or does not strike again.

2590
02:10:37,030 --> 02:10:38,170
Can I make this jump?

2591
02:10:39,670 --> 02:10:41,270
Looks like a big ol' nope to me.

2592
02:10:47,280 --> 02:10:48,880
If I jump over there...

2593
02:10:48,880 --> 02:10:49,360
There's a button.

2594
02:10:49,600 --> 02:10:50,560
Okay, so we can go back.

2595
02:10:51,000 --> 02:10:51,860
Can we go back, though?

2596
02:10:52,900 --> 02:10:53,700
I think we can.

2597
02:10:54,160 --> 02:10:54,760
From up here?

2598
02:10:55,360 --> 02:10:56,220
Should be able to.

2599
02:10:58,580 --> 02:10:59,300
Oh yeah, easy.

2600
02:11:00,100 --> 02:11:00,500
Easy.

2601
02:11:03,380 --> 02:11:04,280
Can we go here?

2602
02:11:11,280 --> 02:11:13,580
Oh, I love that it's consistent with the jumps now.

2603
02:11:14,520 --> 02:11:15,140
You're free!

2604
02:11:18,690 --> 02:11:19,270
What's up?

2605
02:11:21,070 --> 02:11:22,230
Are you releasing me?

2606
02:11:22,590 --> 02:11:23,390
Am I free to go?

2607
02:11:24,690 --> 02:11:26,370
I'll tell you a secret for saving me.

2608
02:11:27,410 --> 02:11:29,990
In order to get into the room where Darunia went...

2609
02:11:29,990 --> 02:11:32,930
I have to do something about the pillars stuck in the ceiling.

2610
02:11:34,470 --> 02:11:37,610
Find a path that leads to a room above the ceiling right away.

2611
02:11:38,770 --> 02:11:39,250
Okay!

2612
02:11:39,830 --> 02:11:40,310
Huge!

2613
02:11:40,490 --> 02:11:40,950
Thanks for that!

2614
02:11:43,720 --> 02:11:44,840
I shall not forget.

2615
02:11:46,540 --> 02:11:47,020
Oh!

2616
02:11:47,380 --> 02:11:48,580
We found a key!

2617
02:11:49,420 --> 02:11:50,380
That's always nice.

2618
02:11:56,680 --> 02:11:58,200
Yeah, I see a big-ass pillar.

2619
02:12:02,030 --> 02:12:02,510
Oh!

2620
02:12:02,710 --> 02:12:04,510
We gotta pluck the hole, I think!

2621
02:12:06,310 --> 02:12:06,790
Unironically.

2622
02:12:08,990 --> 02:12:09,470
Okay!

2623
02:12:09,710 --> 02:12:11,650
Let's go find a way to the top.

2624
02:12:23,320 --> 02:12:24,340
Also, what is the time?

2625
02:12:24,660 --> 02:12:25,140
It's...

2626
02:12:25,140 --> 02:12:25,460
Okay.

2627
02:12:25,460 --> 02:12:26,620
I'm actually gonna skip break.

2628
02:12:26,680 --> 02:12:27,140
I feel great.

2629
02:12:27,920 --> 02:12:28,900
I wanna play more.

2630
02:12:31,780 --> 02:12:33,100
No break today, baby.

2631
02:12:34,780 --> 02:12:35,920
I'm in the zone!

2632
02:12:39,730 --> 02:12:40,950
Now we can enter here.

2633
02:12:48,460 --> 02:12:49,520
Sniper Link is back.

2634
02:12:51,720 --> 02:12:52,660
Okay, hold on.

2635
02:12:52,800 --> 02:12:54,040
Sniper Link starts now.

2636
02:12:57,770 --> 02:12:58,890
It doesn't start now.

2637
02:12:59,670 --> 02:13:00,110
What?

2638
02:13:00,170 --> 02:13:00,630
Why didn't I hit?

2639
02:13:00,710 --> 02:13:01,390
Okay, now we start.

2640
02:13:02,350 --> 02:13:03,490
One shot, one kill.

2641
02:13:10,040 --> 02:13:10,820
Okay, never mind.

2642
02:13:11,020 --> 02:13:11,260
I'm...

2643
02:13:11,260 --> 02:13:11,620
I'm...

2644
02:13:11,620 --> 02:13:12,600
Yeah, it's too far away.

2645
02:13:13,620 --> 02:13:14,580
Look at this room, though.

2646
02:13:16,400 --> 02:13:18,460
I am running a little low on arrows.

2647
02:13:26,980 --> 02:13:27,760
Oh, yeah!

2648
02:13:28,500 --> 02:13:29,280
Wow, look at that.

2649
02:13:31,820 --> 02:13:33,280
It's blasting back and forth.

2650
02:13:37,730 --> 02:13:38,890
Need a key at the end.

2651
02:13:40,550 --> 02:13:43,190
And then we have all kinds of stuff happening over there as well.

2652
02:13:43,830 --> 02:13:45,230
Let's go this way first.

2653
02:13:48,190 --> 02:13:49,710
I have a good feeling about it.

2654
02:13:50,530 --> 02:13:51,070
Wait.

2655
02:13:52,510 --> 02:13:55,370
Okay, I thought someone was knocking on my door.

2656
02:14:02,110 --> 02:14:02,650
What?

2657
02:14:04,070 --> 02:14:04,610
Okay.

2658
02:14:05,330 --> 02:14:06,470
Only 12 arrows left.

2659
02:14:06,630 --> 02:14:07,270
It's a little...

2660
02:14:07,270 --> 02:14:08,410
A little scary.

2661
02:14:08,550 --> 02:14:08,730
Uh-oh.

2662
02:14:10,030 --> 02:14:10,390
No!

2663
02:14:12,950 --> 02:14:13,790
Get up, get up, get up, get up!

2664
02:14:14,590 --> 02:14:15,710
Oh, thank God.

2665
02:14:18,790 --> 02:14:19,150
Scary.

2666
02:14:24,670 --> 02:14:26,290
I don't know why I didn't predict that.

2667
02:14:26,390 --> 02:14:27,450
That was obvious in hindsight.

2668
02:14:27,750 --> 02:14:28,530
Okay, so this is...

2669
02:14:31,070 --> 02:14:32,130
A situation, all right.

2670
02:14:33,910 --> 02:14:34,490
Bomb time?

2671
02:14:39,120 --> 02:14:40,040
Why did you throw it?

2672
02:14:42,400 --> 02:14:43,060
There we go.

2673
02:14:45,500 --> 02:14:46,280
Oh, hell yeah.

2674
02:14:47,920 --> 02:14:50,740
Once again, God Gamer strikes back.

2675
02:14:55,870 --> 02:14:58,650
Thou hast been freed by the one and only Link.

2676
02:15:00,430 --> 02:15:01,510
Are you releasing me?

2677
02:15:01,770 --> 02:15:02,630
Yeah, yeah, you're free to go.

2678
02:15:03,830 --> 02:15:05,570
Okay, what is the secret you're gonna tell me?

2679
02:15:06,310 --> 02:15:08,110
Don't give me the secret about the ceiling thing.

2680
02:15:08,210 --> 02:15:08,830
I know that already.

2681
02:15:10,230 --> 02:15:12,850
There are switches in this temple that you have to cut.

2682
02:15:12,850 --> 02:15:13,910
to activate.

2683
02:15:14,930 --> 02:15:15,430
But...

2684
02:15:15,430 --> 02:15:18,650
You can also use the Goron's special crop to do the job.

2685
02:15:21,030 --> 02:15:22,070
You're talking about bombs.

2686
02:15:23,870 --> 02:15:24,510
Got it.

2687
02:15:26,950 --> 02:15:28,110
You can't fool Link.

2688
02:15:29,350 --> 02:15:30,270
Link is on it.

2689
02:15:32,490 --> 02:15:33,350
Another key!

2690
02:15:34,110 --> 02:15:34,870
Yes, sir.

2691
02:15:35,690 --> 02:15:36,350
Wait a minute.

2692
02:15:36,710 --> 02:15:37,130
Why?

2693
02:15:37,350 --> 02:15:37,610
Okay.

2694
02:15:38,010 --> 02:15:40,290
This guy was in a cell with a key all this time.

2695
02:15:40,650 --> 02:15:42,190
Couldn't he have just escaped with the key?

2696
02:15:43,010 --> 02:15:44,130
And the other guy as well.

2697
02:15:44,290 --> 02:15:44,670
Hmm.

2698
02:15:45,170 --> 02:15:47,030
The bad guys didn't think this through, did they?

2699
02:15:50,230 --> 02:15:52,530
You never want to lock a prisoner in with the key.

2700
02:15:53,550 --> 02:15:54,950
That's just asking for trouble.

2701
02:15:58,320 --> 02:15:58,720
Jump!

2702
02:16:00,660 --> 02:16:02,200
Oh no, everyone spawned back here.

2703
02:16:02,300 --> 02:16:03,160
We can't keep killing them.

2704
02:16:04,900 --> 02:16:06,800
If they come, I'm gonna use my special sauce.

2705
02:16:07,620 --> 02:16:07,820
Oi!

2706
02:16:08,160 --> 02:16:08,540
No!

2707
02:16:10,200 --> 02:16:11,320
That's my special sauce.

2708
02:16:13,300 --> 02:16:15,020
So these need to be lit, I think.

2709
02:16:17,600 --> 02:16:18,660
Let's do a cameo.

2710
02:16:21,660 --> 02:16:23,420
Also, I gotta try the other spell I have more.

2711
02:16:27,900 --> 02:16:28,580
Wow, nothing.

2712
02:16:29,660 --> 02:16:30,940
Do I open that door?

2713
02:16:32,300 --> 02:16:34,080
Or do I explore the other side first?

2714
02:16:35,520 --> 02:16:36,380
Let's open this door.

2715
02:16:41,510 --> 02:16:43,910
Ooh, they got a mining laser or something.

2716
02:16:44,170 --> 02:16:44,250
Ooh!

2717
02:16:44,990 --> 02:16:45,350
What?

2718
02:16:45,990 --> 02:16:46,450
Like...

2719
02:16:50,620 --> 02:16:51,700
That looks very hot.

2720
02:16:53,400 --> 02:16:54,600
Maybe don't stand in that.

2721
02:16:56,000 --> 02:16:57,200
Could I be jumping down there?

2722
02:17:17,060 --> 02:17:18,280
What is going on?

2723
02:17:19,520 --> 02:17:19,980
Oh!

2724
02:17:20,140 --> 02:17:21,260
I can even walk on it.

2725
02:17:21,540 --> 02:17:21,940
What?

2726
02:17:24,600 --> 02:17:25,980
Oh, I'm gonna be sliding.

2727
02:17:32,680 --> 02:17:33,400
Wait a minute.

2728
02:17:37,120 --> 02:17:38,460
Can I let that boost me?

2729
02:17:39,180 --> 02:17:40,500
Can I stand on my shield?

2730
02:17:44,640 --> 02:17:45,100
Hold on.

2731
02:17:45,180 --> 02:17:45,860
What else do I have?

2732
02:17:47,260 --> 02:17:47,620
Uh.

2733
02:17:51,840 --> 02:17:52,640
Come on, take me.

2734
02:17:57,300 --> 02:17:58,280
Up, up, up, up.

2735
02:17:59,900 --> 02:18:00,560
Oh, no.

2736
02:18:00,720 --> 02:18:01,180
Didn't work.

2737
02:18:03,140 --> 02:18:04,220
Well, dang it.

2738
02:18:20,670 --> 02:18:21,750
There's gotta be a way up.

2739
02:18:21,810 --> 02:18:23,010
Otherwise, I can't get back.

2740
02:18:39,550 --> 02:18:40,630
Can we hook back?

2741
02:18:40,910 --> 02:18:41,010
Maybe.

2742
02:18:50,940 --> 02:18:51,740
Oh, wait a minute.

2743
02:18:53,320 --> 02:18:53,980
Ah-ha.

2744
02:18:54,280 --> 02:18:54,720
Oh, no.

2745
02:18:55,960 --> 02:18:56,820
Oh, crap.

2746
02:18:57,200 --> 02:18:57,820
Am I dead?

2747
02:19:01,510 --> 02:19:02,170
Uh-oh.

2748
02:19:05,310 --> 02:19:06,030
Oh, come on.

2749
02:19:12,500 --> 02:19:13,680
What the hell are we doing here?

2750
02:19:17,410 --> 02:19:18,110
It's over!

2751
02:19:18,310 --> 02:19:19,030
I can't do anything!

2752
02:19:28,390 --> 02:19:29,210
What the fuck?

2753
02:19:29,350 --> 02:19:29,630
I'm...

2754
02:19:29,630 --> 02:19:30,530
I'm locked?

2755
02:19:37,700 --> 02:19:38,180
Truth!

2756
02:19:38,440 --> 02:19:38,860
Reveal it!

2757
02:19:42,340 --> 02:19:43,840
This room is so weird!

2758
02:19:52,360 --> 02:19:53,160
There's no way!

2759
02:20:02,260 --> 02:20:03,100
Can I heal?

2760
02:20:03,360 --> 02:20:04,500
Uh, I guess I can heal.

2761
02:20:05,220 --> 02:20:06,980
Maybe release a bug or...

2762
02:20:06,980 --> 02:20:08,180
Also, we have poacher's saw.

2763
02:20:10,460 --> 02:20:10,940
Uh...

2764
02:20:15,450 --> 02:20:16,670
If I had done that!

2765
02:20:17,270 --> 02:20:18,210
Actually, wait a minute.

2766
02:20:19,010 --> 02:20:19,830
Check this out.

2767
02:20:22,450 --> 02:20:24,970
Maybe it'll default me to the entrance when I do this.

2768
02:20:26,350 --> 02:20:27,570
Isn't that what I did last time?

2769
02:20:29,530 --> 02:20:30,450
Check this shit out.

2770
02:20:34,190 --> 02:20:34,630
Yes!

