You'll tell me a secret.

3066
02:37:30,930 --> 02:37:31,330
What is it?

3067
02:37:32,090 --> 02:37:35,990
In this temple, there are doors that fall down when you try to open them.

3068
02:37:36,530 --> 02:37:39,370
When one of these doors starts to fall... Move!

3069
02:37:41,790 --> 02:37:42,270
Okay.

3070
02:37:44,430 --> 02:37:46,650
Doors that fall down when you try to open them.

3071
02:37:47,730 --> 02:37:51,390
If you use a sample of the Goron's special crop, you can break it.

3072
02:37:53,850 --> 02:37:56,410
Dude, their solution to every problem is bombing it.

3073
02:37:57,430 --> 02:37:58,870
That's what they're all about.

3074
02:37:59,250 --> 02:38:00,790
