3081
02:38:21,770 --> 02:38:22,230
Oh, god.

3082
02:38:22,630 --> 02:38:23,390
Oh, Link!

3083
02:38:25,530 --> 02:38:27,370
Good thing we didn't lose much HP there.

3084
02:38:27,490 --> 02:38:27,550
Oh.

3085
02:38:31,430 --> 02:38:32,070
So, wait a minute.

3086
02:38:32,150 --> 02:38:33,130
Something falls, you say?

3087
02:38:37,120 --> 02:38:38,500
