Oh, that's closed as well.

3092
02:39:01,790 --> 02:39:03,890
Strong iron bars are blocking the door.

3093
02:39:04,350 --> 02:39:05,990
You can't open them with your hands.

3094
02:39:06,610 --> 02:39:07,710
