3095
02:39:11,790 --> 02:39:12,570
Do I have a key?

3096
02:39:13,470 --> 02:39:14,470
No, I don't have a key.

3097
02:39:21,360 --> 02:39:22,200
What's down here?

3098
02:39:26,490 --> 02:39:28,570
Oh, that's the big room in the center.

3099
02:39:30,190 --> 02:39:30,890
That's cool.

3100
02:39:32,470 --> 02:39:35,090
Wow, that goes up pretty high.

3101
02:39:35,290 --> 02:39:35,310
