3131
02:41:26,500 --> 02:41:30,740
When you are on fire, you can put it out by swinging your sword, or by rolling forward.

3132
02:41:31,380 --> 02:41:32,260
Did you know that?

3133
02:41:33,040 --> 02:41:37,320
I didn't know about the rolling part, that's common sense, but swinging my sword?

3134
02:41:38,520 --> 02:41:40,500
Can't say I know about that one, but thanks.

3135
02:41:44,410 --> 02:41:45,410
And now we got the key.

3136
02:41:45,650 --> 02:41:46,270
We know what to do with it.

3137
02:41:48,270 --> 02:41:50,010
