3138
02:41:51,030 --> 02:41:52,070
I feel like I'm owning.

3139
02:41:55,440 --> 02:41:56,160
Feels amazing.

3140
02:41:56,800 --> 02:41:57,700
Okay, this way now.

3141
02:41:59,660 --> 02:42:00,340
What was in here?

3142
02:42:00,580 --> 02:42:00,780
Oh!

3143
02:42:01,220 --> 02:42:02,240
I see through walls!

3144
02:42:05,600 --> 02:42:07,540
ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

3145
02:42:07,540 --> 02:42:07,620
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

3146
02:42:08,160 --> 02:42:09,540
Ha-ha-ha-ha!

3147
02:42:09,540 --> 02:42:10,340
Hey-hey!

3148
02:42:12,280 --> 02:42:13,240
Cheating, cheating!

3149
02:42:18,650 --> 02:42:19,390
Wall hack!

3150
02:42:20,830 --> 02:42:21,690
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha!

3151
02:42:22,790 --> 02:42:25,190
Now, of course I would have heard it anyway, come on!

3152
02:42:27,310 --> 02:42:29,570
There is no mistaking a Gold School Tula.

3153
02:42:30,530 --> 02:42:31,730
Everyone knows that.

3154
02:42:38,310 --> 02:42:39,510
Let's set up here again.

3155
02:42:42,070 --> 02:42:42,970
And in here.

3156
02:42:47,280 --> 02:42:49,260
And now we can open this bastard.

3157
02:42:51,640 --> 02:42:52,800
Oh, it's so good.

3158
02:42:53,580 --> 02:42:54,900
Great level design.

3159
02:42:59,860 --> 02:43:02,000
Okay, I have a bad feeling about this.

3160
02:43:03,060 --> 02:43:06,100
That is something out of Super Mario 64.

3161
02:43:09,400 --> 02:43:11,000
Which I guess is not too surprising.

3162
02:43:11,220 --> 02:43:11,960
Made by Nintendo.

3163
02:43:16,050 --> 02:43:17,070
Oh, shit.

3164
02:43:17,670 --> 02:43:18,010
Oh!

3165
02:43:18,610 --> 02:43:19,090
Run!

3166
02:43:19,950 --> 02:43:21,030
The fire's coming.

3167
02:43:22,250 --> 02:43:22,630
Yeah!

3168
02:43:22,970 --> 02:43:24,250
Oh, you bastard!

3169
02:43:26,010 --> 02:43:26,550
Wow!

3170
02:43:28,250 --> 02:43:29,330
Sneaky, sneaky, sneaky.

3171
02:43:30,570 --> 02:43:31,530
That got me good.

3172
02:43:34,780 --> 02:43:35,440
Let's go.

3173
02:43:35,620 --> 02:43:36,160
I think we're safe.

3174
02:43:38,400 --> 02:43:40,080
Quickly go up before the fire comes.

3175
02:43:41,560 --> 02:43:42,100
Nice.

3176
