I see a door over there with a keyhole in it.

3177
02:43:49,220 --> 02:43:51,160
Oh, this is where I was before.

3178
02:43:51,800 --> 02:43:52,160
Look.

3179
02:43:53,760 --> 02:43:54,120
Sweet.

3180
02:43:58,490 --> 02:43:59,330
You know what's funny?

3181
02:43:59,550 --> 02:44:01,210
So, I look at this level here, right?

3182
02:44:02,210 --> 02:44:06,050
And I think to myself, damn, this is actually kind of simple when you think about it.

3183
02:44:06,530 --> 02:44:08,070
It's a super simple design.

3184
02:44:08,710 --> 02:44:10,190
I could have come up with that, right?

3185
02:44:11,090 --> 02:44:12,350
Answer is probably not.

3186
02:44:14,450 --> 02:44:21,850
This is... It's very hard to make a level that is both simple, satisfying, and interconnected like this.

3187
02:44:21,950 --> 02:44:24,170
It is really... art.

3188
02:44:24,810 --> 02:44:25,670
You know what I mean?

3189
02:44:26,250 --> 02:44:28,490
Like, it looks simple, but I promise you it's not.

3190
02:44:28,630 --> 02:44:30,950
Like, making something as good as this, it's not simple.

3191
02:44:34,170 --> 02:44:35,090
It's really nice.

3192
02:44:39,560 --> 02:44:42,960
And of course, it looks more simple, uh, because it's, like, low poly, right?

3193
02:44:44,460 --> 02:44:46,500
You get the sort of... Oh, oh, wait a minute.

3194
02:44:48,960 --> 02:44:49,780
Blow that up.

3195
02:44:51,280 --> 02:44:52,580
Navi, I don't need your hints.

3196
02:44:52,900 --> 02:44:53,640
Thank you very much.

3197
02:44:55,060 --> 02:44:55,640
Shut up!

3198
02:45:05,030 --> 02:45:06,650
I'm afraid to jump off in case I die.

3199
02:45:08,970 --> 02:45:09,990
We're crawling down.

3200
02:45:13,320 --> 02:45:14,260
