3201
02:45:15,440 --> 02:45:16,620
Ooh, that's a lot of floors.

3202
02:45:19,560 --> 02:45:21,020
Something's hiding all the way at the end.

3203
02:45:32,430 --> 02:45:32,870
Aha!

3204
02:45:37,170 --> 02:45:37,870
You're free!

3205
02:45:40,050 --> 02:45:41,830
Now, you're not free for nothing.

3206
02:45:41,830 --> 02:45:44,070
You gotta hand over a tip before I can let you go.

3207
02:45:46,190 --> 02:45:46,770
That's it.

3208
02:45:46,950 --> 02:45:47,450
Let me hear it.

3209
02:45:48,390 --> 02:45:53,190
Somewhere in this temple, you're sure to meet up with some creatures that dance as they attack.

3210
02:45:53,830 --> 02:45:54,890
Arrows won't hurt them.

3211
02:45:55,950 --> 02:45:59,290
Looks like you might need some of the Goron special crop.

3212
02:46:01,070 --> 02:46:01,550
Ah.

3213
02:46:03,850 --> 02:46:06,250
You need some of that Goron special crop.

3214
02:46:11,600 --> 02:46:12,080
Awesome.

3215
02:46:13,200 --> 02:46:13,920
More keys.

3216
02:46:14,040 --> 02:46:15,720
I found so many keys in this dungeon.

3217
02:46:16,840 --> 02:46:18,060
And now I'm back here.

3218
02:46:21,020 --> 02:46:21,700
Wait, what is that sound?

3219
02:46:22,400 --> 02:46:23,440
Is that just these things?

3220
02:46:28,440 --> 02:46:29,420
Yeah, I think it is.

3221
02:46:30,720 --> 02:46:32,020
They're making a funky sound.

3222
02:46:34,280 --> 02:46:37,180
Dude, doesn't that look like the one creature from SpongeBob?

3223
02:46:37,900 --> 02:46:39,860
Now, I haven't seen the show, but there's one guy.

3224
02:46:40,960 --> 02:46:42,240
The guy who runs the restaurant.

3225
02:46:43,480 --> 02:46:45,120
Like, look when he perks up.

3226
02:46:50,170 --> 02:46:50,950
The eyes!

3227
02:46:54,910 --> 02:46:55,990
Are you not gonna...

3228
02:46:57,050 --> 02:46:57,410
Okay.

3229
02:46:58,710 --> 02:46:59,550
Let's take you out.

3230
02:47:03,290 --> 02:47:03,850
There we go.

3231
02:47:05,070 --> 02:47:05,890
You know what I mean.

3232
02:47:06,630 --> 02:47:06,990
Maybe.

3233
02:47:08,090 --> 02:47:08,830
Maybe you don't.

3234
02:47:10,390 --> 02:47:11,450
Oh, we gotta do this again!

3235
02:47:13,690 --> 02:47:14,230
