3236
02:47:26,160 --> 02:47:30,300
Like, this right here feels a little unintended and janky, but it's probably because I'm doing it wrong.

3237
02:47:30,300 --> 02:47:33,300
So, by jumping a little sideways onto that, maybe that's not intended.

3238
02:47:33,440 --> 02:47:33,700
I don't know.

3239
02:47:34,340 --> 02:47:36,120
Maybe I'm missing a more obvious way to do this.

3240
02:47:46,990 --> 02:47:47,390
Oh, wait.

3241
02:47:47,550 --> 02:47:48,230
Uh, not yet.

3242
02:47:48,250 --> 02:47:48,490
Not yet.

3243
02:47:54,120 --> 02:47:54,580
Oh, no.

3244
02:47:54,620 --> 02:47:55,140
I needed to...

3245
02:47:55,880 --> 02:47:56,260
Oh, no.

3246
02:47:56,280 --> 02:47:57,120
We can actually jump up here.

3247
02:48:07,410 --> 02:48:09,410
You probably could have made it with a bow shot as well.

3248
02:48:10,570 --> 02:48:10,890
All right.

3249
02:48:10,890 --> 02:48:11,590
You have plenty of time.

3250
02:48:22,430 --> 02:48:22,750
Okay.

3251
02:48:22,930 --> 02:48:23,110
Now.

3252
02:48:23,390 --> 02:48:23,710
Oh.

3253
02:48:29,350 --> 02:48:30,430
There's a button up there.

3254
02:48:31,170 --> 02:48:32,350
We gotta go press that.

3255
02:48:34,980 --> 02:48:36,460
And the way to do that?

3256
02:48:36,840 --> 02:48:38,080
I'm not sure.

3257
02:48:38,400 --> 02:48:38,480
Oh.

3258
02:48:38,760 --> 02:48:38,960
Careful.

3259
02:48:40,640 --> 02:48:41,560
Much more with this.

3260
02:48:41,740 --> 02:48:42,080
Oh, God.

3261
02:48:48,060 --> 02:48:49,980
I'm gonna be a little lost here, but that's okay.

3262
02:48:51,520 --> 02:48:51,940
Okay.

3263
02:48:52,000 --> 02:48:52,600
So, this is not it.

3264
02:49:00,670 --> 02:49:01,330
This way.

3265
02:49:10,820 --> 02:49:12,060
I'm not doing this very well.

3266
02:49:15,730 --> 02:49:16,150
Here.

3267
02:49:17,390 --> 02:49:17,810
Wait.

3268
02:49:18,410 --> 02:49:18,830
Weesh.

3269
02:49:21,070 --> 02:49:22,230
Uh, not here.

3270
02:49:25,530 --> 02:49:26,190
Oh, God.

3271
02:49:26,890 --> 02:49:27,790
I'm so bad.

3272
02:49:30,030 --> 02:49:31,470
Link, stop targeting that.

3273
02:49:32,770 --> 02:49:33,130
Okay.

3274
02:49:33,150 --> 02:49:33,610
This is a dead end.

3275
02:49:35,110 --> 02:49:35,550
Oof.

3276
02:49:36,290 --> 02:49:37,050
Don't you do that.

3277
02:49:44,440 --> 02:49:45,840
Good thing we have a lot of HP.

3278
02:49:46,800 --> 02:49:47,800
Not very punishing.

3279
02:49:52,130 --> 02:49:52,570
Okay.

3280
02:49:52,730 --> 02:49:53,650
So, we walk here now.

3281
02:50:01,090 --> 02:50:02,130
The fire's gonna come.

3282
02:50:03,570 --> 02:50:05,410
Is there anything else we can do on the way?

3283
02:50:08,230 --> 02:50:08,950
Wait, did we...

3284
02:50:08,950 --> 02:50:11,370
Did we use the key we got already, or do we have it?

3285
02:50:15,310 --> 02:50:16,010
