3289
02:50:22,330 --> 02:50:22,670
Bottom left.

3290
02:50:23,310 --> 02:50:25,070
We got one key, so we can actually get up there.

3291
02:50:25,930 --> 02:50:26,250
Potentially.

3292
02:50:27,410 --> 02:50:28,350
The question is how.

3293
02:50:40,650 --> 02:50:41,610
Yeah, now we gotta go.

3294
02:50:45,420 --> 02:50:46,080
Can't fool me.

3295
02:50:48,970 --> 02:50:50,230
Can we jump up on this pillar?

3296
02:50:51,830 --> 02:50:52,630
Oh, nice.

3297
02:50:52,950 --> 02:50:53,930
Are we safe from fire?

3298
02:50:57,570 --> 02:50:57,970
Sweet.

3299
02:51:02,700 --> 02:51:04,260
