3300
02:51:21,110 --> 02:51:21,590
Oh, God.

3301
02:51:21,730 --> 02:51:21,930
It's coming.

3302
02:51:22,050 --> 02:51:22,190
It's coming.

3303
02:51:25,000 --> 02:51:26,400
I can't just jump from here, right?

3304
02:51:26,480 --> 02:51:26,920
There's no way.

3305
02:51:27,560 --> 02:51:28,120
Yeah, there's no way.

3306
02:51:29,040 --> 02:51:29,320
Huh.

3307
02:51:31,900 --> 02:51:33,200
Maybe I can hookshot something?

3308
02:51:49,380 --> 02:51:50,400
That is weird.

3309
02:51:56,270 --> 02:51:58,790
Part of me wants to think in terms of Super Mario 64.

3310
02:51:58,830 --> 02:51:59,890
You get hit by the fire.

3311
02:51:59,890 --> 02:52:00,690
You go...

3312
02:52:02,290 --> 02:52:04,270
And you fly up in the air, and you land up here.

3313
02:52:05,770 --> 02:52:08,230
