3314
02:52:10,090 --> 02:52:10,790
I don't know.

3315
02:52:13,090 --> 02:52:14,610
Let me actually try and get hit by this.

3316
02:52:15,370 --> 02:52:15,930
All right, Link.

3317
02:52:16,250 --> 02:52:16,750
Come on.

3318
02:52:22,260 --> 02:52:23,000
Hold the line.

3319
02:52:26,480 --> 02:52:26,840
Oi.

3320
02:52:27,800 --> 02:52:28,380
Okay, yeah.

3321
02:52:28,500 --> 02:52:29,480
I just get hit.

3322
02:52:29,600 --> 02:52:30,800
Okay, it's not even that scary.

3323
02:52:32,720 --> 02:52:33,980
Now I'm not afraid of it anymore.

3324
02:52:36,930 --> 02:52:38,090
Dude, how the hell?

3325
02:52:45,510 --> 02:52:47,130
Everything is salt with bombs in here, right?

3326
